`section.content` is typed as `SchemaNode | SchemaNode[]`, but this code passes it directly to `<SchemaRenderer>`. If `section.content` is an array, `SchemaRenderer` will receive an array and attempt to treat it like a schema object, which will break rendering. Handle arrays explicitly (map and render each node) before calling `SchemaRenderer`.
```suggestion
                {section.content &&
                  (Array.isArray(section.content) ? (
                    section.content.map((node, idx) => (
                      <SchemaRenderer
                        key={node.id ?? idx}
                        schema={node}
                      />
                    ))
                  ) : (
                    <SchemaRenderer schema={section.content} />
                  ))}
```
